---
layout: base.njk
title: Professional Dental Care in Ahmedabad
description: Smile Dental Clinic provides comprehensive dental care including cleanings, root canals, implants, and orthodontics in Ahmedabad.
activePage: home
---

<!-- Hero Section -->
<section id="hero" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-content">
    <h1>Your Smile is Our Priority</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">Professional Dental Care in Ahmedabad</p>
    <p class="hero-tagline">From routine cleanings to advanced treatments, we provide comprehensive dental solutions with care and expertise.</p>
    <div class="cta-buttons">
      <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Book Appointment</a>
      <a href="#services" class="btn btn-secondary">Explore Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- About Section -->
