</section>

<!-- FAQ Section -->
<section id="faq" class="faq">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p>Find answers to common questions about our services and procedures</p>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">How often should I visit the dentist?</div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We recommend visiting the dentist at least twice a year for routine checkups and cleanings. However, individuals with specific dental conditions may need more frequent visits. We'll create a personalized care plan for you.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">Is a root canal procedure painful?</div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Modern root canal treatments are not painful. We use local anesthesia to numb the area completely. Many patients report that the procedure is actually no more uncomfortable than getting a filling. Our goal is to eliminate pain, not cause it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">What is the recovery time after dental implants?</div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Initial healing typically takes 1-2 weeks, during which you may experience minor swelling. Full osseointegration (where the implant fuses with the bone) takes 3-6 months. We provide detailed post-operative care instructions to ensure optimal results.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">Do you accept insurance?</div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We work with many major insurance providers. We recommend contacting us directly at {{ site.phone_display }} to discuss your coverage. We also offer flexible payment options to make quality dental care accessible.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">How long does an orthodontics treatment typically take?</div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Most orthodontics treatments take 18-24 months, depending on the complexity of your case. We use modern techniques including traditional braces and clear aligners. During your consultation, we'll provide a personalized timeline.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <div class="faq-question">What should I do if I have a dental emergency?</div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Call us immediately at {{ site.phone_display }}. We reserve time for emergency patients and will do our best to see you the same day. In case of severe trauma, visit the nearest emergency room first, then contact us.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Contact Section -->
<section id="contact" class="contact">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>Get In Touch</h2>
      <p>Ready to book your appointment? Contact us today or fill out the form below.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="contact-wrapper">
      <form id="contact-form" class="contact-form">
        <div class="form-message"></div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="name">Your Name *</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required />
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="email">Email Address *</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required />
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="phone">Phone Number</label>
          <input type="tel" id="phone" name="phone" />
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="service">Service of Interest</label>
          <select id="service" name="service" style="width: 100%; padding: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 2); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 6px; font-family: inherit; font-size: 14px;">
            <option value="">Select a service...</option>
            <option value="General Dentistry">General Dentistry</option>
            <option value="Dental Cleanings">Dental Cleanings</option>
            <option value="Root Canals">Root Canals</option>
            <option value="Dental Implants">Dental Implants</option>
            <option value="Orthodontics">Orthodontics</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="message">Message *</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" required></textarea>
        </div>

        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New appointment request from Smile Dental" />
        <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" />

        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">Send Message</button>
      </form>

      <div class="contact-info">
        <div class="info-block">
          <h3>📞 Phone</h3>
          <p>
            <a href="tel:{{ site.phone }}">{{ site.phone_display }}</a>
          </p>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; margin-top: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 1);">Call us to book an appointment or discuss your dental concerns.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-block">
          <h3>📧 Email</h3>
          <p>
            <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
          </p>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; margin-top: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 1);">Send us your questions anytime. We'll respond within 24 hours.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-block">
          <h3>📍 Location</h3>
          <p>{{ site.address }}</p>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; margin-top: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 1);">Visit us in beautiful Ellisbridge, Ahmedabad.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="info-block">
          <h3>💬 Quick Message</h3>
          <p>
            <a href="https://wa.me/919999000000?text=Hi!%20I'd%20like%20to%20book%20an%20appointment%20at%20Smile%20Dental%20Clinic." target="_blank" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 1);">
              WhatsApp Us →
            </a>
          </p>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; margin-top: calc(var(--spacing-unit) * 1);">Message us on WhatsApp for quick responses.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
